== Trivia ==
*'''Dackinoru''' has no dialogue unless having purchased [[Alabaster]]'s tip. After talking to them, they will no longer give dialogue.
*'''Dackinoru''' does, however, display text above their head, as if communicating with the other [[NPC]]s in the {{zone|Shifted Tavern}}.
*The name and design of '''Dackinoru''' were created by Planet Minecraft user aneckdope.

